                                                "sense_id": "c113baff-758a-3822-b6d1-49b9904371e3",
                                                "text": "Dr. Caius, the Frenchman in the play, and Evans the Welshman, \"Gallia et Guallia,\" succeed pretty well in their efforts to murder the language."
